# Local instruction

This is an isolated Python project. README owns navigation, requirements.md owns behavior, docs/api.md owns API usage, ops/README.md owns execution. Tests use Python unittest: python -m unittest discover -s tests -v. Python standard library only. A technical plan and continuation belong in .highgrade/local/. No native specification catalog is assigned; do not create one. A changed requirement needs a user decision. No commit, publication, activation, external calls or unrelated file edits are assigned. No separate review barrier is assigned in this synthetic project.
